      optsEn: ['~4,000 L, max ~3.0 press.; replace water nightly (<1 day)', 'Top off leftover potable water remaining from yesterday', 'Store potable hoses inside the lavatory waste compartment', 'Pump untreated industrial water directly into cabin tanks'],
