      optsEn: ['~53.4m blast, ~140kg idle suction, watchman ≥5m clear', 'Only 3 m aft hazard zone and ~5 kg intake suction at idle', 'Stand 1 m directly beside the engine cowling during watch', 'Safe to walk across directly in front of the intake at idle'],
